{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/74233-vhs-movie","id":74233,"title":"VHS Movie","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-18T06:35:54-08:00","id":74233,"title":"VHS Movie","content":"So after finishing the movie:<br /> <br /> VHS: <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt2105044/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.imdb.com/title/tt2105044/</a><br /> <br /> I feel kind of dirty. I know its a movie and all but it scared the crap out of me. Especially the Succubus short... made my manhood hurt a tad bit.<br /> <br /> But I have to wonder if anyone else has watched this movie and mined it? It's ripe for Hunter pillaging.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/213-darkhunter","name":"Darkhunter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar213_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-18T09:32:37-08:00","id":74318,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah, its an excellent movie for hunter games, and other concepts like that. Its just got a bunch of spooky situations in it that have that &quot;Whole lot of Weird&quot; vibe that is the core of NWoD.<br /> <br /> Now... Don't bother with VHS 2... its terrible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-18T09:52:41-08:00","id":74340,"title":"","content":"I heard there is a more to the Succubus thing story in part 2. Is that true?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/213-darkhunter","name":"Darkhunter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar213_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-18T09:54:28-08:00","id":74342,"title":"","content":"I really liked V/H/S 2. But, I liked The ABC's of Death as well...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-18T12:19:39-08:00","id":74450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darkhunter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/74233-vhs-movie?p=74340#post74340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I heard there is a more to the Succubus thing story in part 2. Is that true?</div> </div> </div> </div>No.<br /> I didn't like part 2, it wasn't as good as part one, though the connection story was probably the best. That one does continue off the connecting story from part 1.<br /> <br /> ABCs of Death was good too, but more as an experimental thing than for stories. Lots of horror flicks are good for hunter, or mortal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 02-18-2014, 03:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T15:38:51-08:00","id":75291,"title":"","content":"Part two had it's moments but seriously Aliens?<br /> <br /> The ending was awful and VHS 1 was hands down better.<br /> <br /> Liked the Zombies in the woods however.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/213-darkhunter","name":"Darkhunter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar213_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T05:51:44-08:00","id":77010,"title":"","content":"V/H/S 2 isn't horrible it's just overrated. The whole cult story seems to get everyone off. I personally loved the first two stories. The first especially as it fits into the Cherion Group perfectly. Both are great plots for using Network Zero as either PC's or as plot hooks.<br /> <br /> ABC's of Death is beyond awful. I mean it's like they took Uwe Boll's ideas that he threw away and used them. I absolutely hate that film.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T03:04:50-08:00","id":81489,"title":"","content":"We had this thread as the last Forums ended. Basically I suggested flat out using the VHS movie as a prop in the game, or at least have the movie serve as scenarios the group can encounter or VHS's they can find.<br /> <br /> May I also suggest All Hallows' Eve, its a great scary anthology too, and has an evil Clown!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T03:11:51-07:00","id":92206,"title":"","content":"Did you ever use the VHS tapes?<br /> <br /> And which group would they be useful for? Network Zero?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/213-darkhunter","name":"Darkhunter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar213_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T02:04:00-07:00","id":93317,"title":"","content":"I plan to literally do just that, with Network Zero, if I ever Run a Hunter the Vigil game! But I haven't ran a Hunter the Vigil game yet, only things like Mortal before Hunter came out, and Mortal Preludes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T11:12:26-07:00","id":97624,"title":"","content":"I've never heard of All Hallows Eve. Only thing I heard of was Trick or Treat","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/213-darkhunter","name":"Darkhunter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar213_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T15:22:02-07:00","id":97790,"title":"","content":"Its pretty recent from this Halloween, Its good in my opinion. <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt2900624/?ref_=nv_sr_1\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.imdb.com/title/tt2900624/?ref_=nv_sr_1</a><br /> <br /> The Mimeclown that ties it all together could be a disturbing foe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avata